Click the TEST-10019 link
Open "Medical Record" charttab
Click the Allergies/Medications charttab subtab
Begin Add an allergy of Benadryl using the Quick Allergy page
	Click the "Quick Allergy" link
	Enter Benadryl into the 1st autocomplete
	Type Rash into the @Reaction Input@id=qagy_reaction0
	Enter 02-02-2007 into the qagy_start_date0 date
	Click the Add button
Begin Verify Benadryl allergy
	Verify exists Benadryl text
	Click the Prescribe link
	Enter "Benadryl" into the 1st autocomplete
	Type "capsule 25mg" in the "qp_formacval0" autocomplete
	@Pause@driver.pause(5)
#	@Wait for Benadryl warning@driver.wcutils.waitForEle(xpath='//div[@class="wc_win"]//*[contains(., "Warning for Benadryl")]', timeout=120)
#	Close the "Warning for Benadryl" popup
#	Enter "capsule 25mg" into the 2nd autocomplete
	Type "1 cap po bid" in the "Practitioner Sig" autocomplete
	Type "60" in the "qp_total_quantity0" input
	Type "1" in the "qp_refills0" input
	Begin "Warning for Benadryl modal"
		Verify exists "Warning for Benadryl" text
		Click the Close popup button
	Click the "Prescribe" button
Begin Delete the Benadryl allergy
	screenshot diff
	Open "Medical Record" charttab
	screenshot diff
	Click the Allergies/Medications charttab
	screenshot diffupper
	@Scroll down@driver.scrollTo(y=900)
	screenshot difflower
	Click the 1st !Delete link
	screenshot diffupper
	@Scroll down@driver.scrollTo(y=900)
	screenshot difflower
	Verify exists Benadryl text
	screenshot diffupper
	@Scroll down@driver.scrollTo(y=900)
	screenshot difflower
	Type deleted into the Reason autocomplete
	screenshot diffupper
	@Scroll down@driver.scrollTo(y=900)
	screenshot difflower
	Click the Submit button
	screenshot diffupper
	@Scroll down@driver.scrollTo(y=900)
	screenshot difflower
	Verify exists "Successfully deleted allergy" text
	screenshot diffupper
	@Scroll down@driver.scrollTo(y=900)
	screenshot difflower
	Begin "Check Unsent Prescription"
		Verify exists "Unsent Prescriptions" text
		Verify exists "Benadryl capsule 25mg" listview link
		Verify exists "Do NOT Send" listview link
		Click the "Do NOT Send" link
	Open "Medical Record" charttab
	Click the Allergies/Medications charttab
	Verify !exists Benadryl text
